

Huaputa tuhi: ((Rārangi ← ['red'] ; ['green']) + (Rārangi ← ['blue'])), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Rārangi ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 1), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Rārangi ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 2), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Rārangi ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 3), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Rārangi ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - -2), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Rārangi ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 4), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Rārangi ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 13), rārangi-hou.


